            "source_segment_index": 2437,
            "start_ms": 4664220,
            "end_ms": 4667180,
            "text": "故意杀杀错了哦"
          },
          {
            "index": 2438,
            "source_segment_index": 2438,
            "start_ms": 4667180,
            "end_ms": 4669180,
            "text": "给各位大老师们做本九局的复盘"
          },
          {
            "index": 2439,
            "source_segment_index": 2439,
            "start_ms": 4669180,
            "end_ms": 4672499,
            "text": "本局版新为为零侍从神人阵营预言家"
          },
          {
